  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/03f606139c736cc1af8c6f5c78ea44c324f88530185109c0f836e68c8ced7a54.png] \n\nBy checking options and interchanging signs - and +,\n\n(1) 10 ÷ 5 - 10 + 5 = 8\n\nLHS = 10 ÷ 5 + 10 - 5\n\n= 2 + 10 - 5\n\n= 12 - 5 \n\n= 7 \n\n≠ 8 \n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n(2) 9 - 6 × 2 + 8 = 11\n\nLHS = 9 + 6 × 2 - 8\n\n= 9 + 12 - 8\n\n= 21 - 8\n\n= 13\n\n≠ 11\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**(3) 12 + 3 × 2 - 4 = 10**\n\n**LHS = 12 - 3 × 2 + 4**\n\n**= 12 - 6 ****+ 4**\n\n**= 16 - 6**\n\n**= 10**\n\n**= RHS**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\n(4) 7 × 3 + 9 - 6 = 17\n\nLHS = 7 × 3 - 9 + 6\n\n= 21 - 9 + 6\n\n= 27 - 9 \n\n= 18\n\n≠ 17\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, 12 + 3 × 2 - 4 = 10 is the correct answer.",
